<!-- .claude/loop.md — customizes what a bare `/loop` (no prompt) does in this repo.
     Keep it a short, safe maintenance checklist. -->

Tend this branch's open PR:
- Check CI status (`gh pr checks`); if red, collect the failing logs and triage —
  fix clear failures at root cause, escalate anything ambiguous. Don't churn.
- Surface new review comments that need a response.
- Flag merge conflicts with the base branch.

Never push tags, force-push, or take any release / billed action. If nothing
needs doing, stop and say so.
